  WrittenDialogue: "Oh shit didn’t think I’d see you here.\nLong story short, my taste for really pure heroin got me pretty far in debt.\nI had a couple freak outs and my agent dropped me.\nOh but I’m not off heroin, I just found an industry that better suits my needs and lets me afford it.\nAnd it’s not “porn”! It’s hardcore erotica, thank you.\nOkay it’s porn but it’s really smart and conceptual.\nAnd feminism says this is empowering now!\nWell ugly feminists say it’s demeaning but pretty feminists say it’s empowering.\nI made the cover of “Women Are Worthless Whores 78” and I felt pretty empowered.\nYeah this is good. This is the best course my life could’ve ever taken."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
